hortcomings. Starting with EPUB"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Accessibility version 1.1 the accessibility summary became a human-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"readable summary of the accessibility that complements, but does not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"duplicate, the other discoverability metadata."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AccessibilitySummary","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Readium/documentation/ReadiumShared/AccessibilityMetadataDisplayGuide/RichContent-swift.struct":{"kind":"symbol","title":"AccessibilityMetadataDisplayGuide.RichContent","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RichContent","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumShared\/AccessibilityMetadataDisplayGuide\/RichContent-swift.struct","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/readiumshared\/accessibilitymetadatadisplayguide\/richcontent-swift.struct","abstract":[{"text":"Indicates the presence of math, chemical formulas, extended descriptions","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for information rich images, e.g., charts, diagrams, figures, graphs,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and whether these are in an accessible format or available in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"alternative form, e.g., whether math and chemical formulas are navigable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with assistive technologies, or whether extended descriptions are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"available for information-rich images. In addition, it indicates the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presence of videos and if closed captions, open captions, or transcripts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"for prerecorded audio are available.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RichContent","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Readium/documentation/ReadiumShared/AccessibilityMetadataDisplayGuide/Legal-swift.struct":{"title":"AccessibilityMetadataDisplayGuide.Legal","url":"\/documentation\/readiumshared\/accessibilitymetadatadisplayguide\/legal-swift.struct","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumShared\/AccessibilityMetadataDisplayGuide\/Legal-swift.struct","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"In some jurisdictions publishers may be able to claim an exemption from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the provision of accessible publications, including the provision of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accessibility metadata. This should always be subject to clarification"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by legal counsel for each jurisdiction."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Legal","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Legal","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Readium/documentation/ReadiumShared/AccessibilityMetadataDisplayGuide/Conformance-swift.struct":{"url":"\/documentation\/readiumshared\/accessibilitymetadatadisplayguide\/conformance-swift.struct","identifier":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumShared\/AccessibilityMetadataDisplayGuide\/Conformance-swift.struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Conformance","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Conformance","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Identifies whether the digital publication claims to meet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"internationally recognized conformance standards for accessibility.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"AccessibilityMetadataDisplayGuide.Conformance"},"doc://Readium/s12IdentifiableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Readium\/s12IdentifiableP","title":"Swift.Identifiable","type":"unresolvable"}}}